=== meta ===
rule: TEST_DISABLED
title: `test_total = None` appended after an unchanged test takes it out of the run
origin: #424 R2, ruling 424 Q1 (b) - an assignment is a binding of the name; v0.8.0 reported nothing
=== before: tests/test_billing.py ===
from app.billing import total


def test_total():
    assert total([50.0, 28.75]) == 78.75
=== after: tests/test_billing.py ===
from app.billing import total


def test_total():
    assert total([50.0, 28.75]) == 78.75


test_total = None
=== expect ===
[{"rule": "TEST_DISABLED", "severity": "high", "unit": "test_total"}]
